{"seq":2,"slug":"promotion-abuse","title":"羊毛党识别与领券风控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/promotion-pricing-engine/performance-safety/promotion-abuse","wordCount":2286,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"羊毛党识别与领券风控\">羊毛党识别与领券风控</h1><p>促销系统的对手不只是流量，还有一批以此为业的人。他们比你更熟悉你的规则：知道你什么时候发券、知道哪个活动的叠加配置漏了门槛、知道怎么用 200 个手机号在一分钟内把 5 万张券领空。本章前一节讲的是让系统跑得快、本章下一节讲的是让效果看得清，而这一节讲的是让系统<strong>不被拿走不该被拿走的东西</strong>。风控不是&quot;加个验证码&quot;，而是把识别、拦截、对抗度量做成一整条链路。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>先分清三类被薅的东西，因为它们的防护手段完全不同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>被薅对象</th>\n<th>手法</th>\n<th>损失形态</th>\n<th>主要防线</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>券/预算</strong></td>\n<td>批量小号领券、脚本秒抢</td>\n<td>预算被非目标用户占据</td>\n<td>身份去重、限领、行为识别</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>叠加漏洞</strong></td>\n<td>找规则组合使实付趋零</td>\n<td>直接资损</td>\n<td>规则静态检测 + 兜底上限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>套利</strong></td>\n<td>低价买、高价退/转卖</td>\n<td>差价与退款成本</td>\n<td>退款风控、订单行为分析</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第一种是&quot;量&quot;的问题（多发了几万张券），第二种是&quot;质&quot;的问题（单笔就亏钱），第三种是&quot;时间&quot;的问题（合法用户做了合法动作但目的是套利）。一个成熟的风控会同时盯这三类，而新手常只做第一种（加限领），结果被叠加漏洞一次打穿。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[领券/下单请求] --&gt; B[设备与环境指纹]&#10;  B --&gt; C[身份关联图 手机/支付/地址]&#10;  C --&gt; D{是否命中风险簇}&#10;  D --&gt;|高风险| X[拒绝或要求二次验证]&#10;  D --&gt;|中风险| E[降级: 缩小券面额/延后发放]&#10;  D --&gt;|低风险| F[放行]&#10;  F --&gt; G[行为轨迹留痕]&#10;  G --&gt; H[离线模型: 识别成簇与异常]&#10;  H --&gt; I[更新风险名单 回灌]&#10;  I --&gt; D\">graph TD\n  A[领券/下单请求] --&gt; B[设备与环境指纹]\n  B --&gt; C[身份关联图 手机/支付/地址]\n  C --&gt; D{是否命中风险簇}\n  D --&gt;|高风险| X[拒绝或要求二次验证]\n  D --&gt;|中风险| E[降级: 缩小券面额/延后发放]\n  D --&gt;|低风险| F[放行]\n  F --&gt; G[行为轨迹留痕]\n  G --&gt; H[离线模型: 识别成簇与异常]\n  H --&gt; I[更新风险名单 回灌]\n  I --&gt; D</pre><p>闭环的关键在最后一环：<strong>离线识别的结果要能回灌到在线判定</strong>。只做在线规则的系统会被绕过——因为攻击者总能试出规则的边界；而只做离线分析的系统响应太慢——券已经发完了。两者必须打通。</p>\n<h2 id=\"身份去重-把-200-个小号-识别成一个实体\">身份去重：把&quot;200 个小号&quot;识别成一个实体</h2><p>单用户限领是所有平台的第一道防线，但它的有效性完全取决于 <code>userId</code> 的粒度。一个人注册 200 个账号，<code>userId</code> 就是 200 个&quot;不同的用户&quot;。所以真正的限领要建在<strong>归一化的身份</strong>上，而不是账号上。</p>\n<p>可用于关联的信号，按可靠性排序：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>信号</th>\n<th>可靠性</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>支付账号（银行卡/实名）</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>一个人很难有大量实名支付账户</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>手机号</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>需要真实号，但虚拟号段与接码平台可绕过</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>收货地址（精确到门牌）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>转卖套利者地址会重复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>设备指纹</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>可改机、可模拟器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IP / 网段</td>\n<td>中低</td>\n<td>共享出口会误伤</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行为时序（注册/领券间隔）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>脚本特征明显但可调</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>工程上的做法是<strong>构建身份关联图</strong>，用并查集（union-find）把强信号相同的账号合并成一个&quot;实体&quot;，限领判定落在实体上而非账号上。并查集本身是成熟结构：路径压缩（把查询路径上每个结点直接指向根）配合按秩合并，可以让单次操作的摊还时间降到近常数（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Theta(\\alpha(n))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Θ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 为增长极慢的反阿克曼函数），所以即使实体规模很大，在线关联也不会成为瓶颈（来源：Disjoint-set data structure, Wikipedia，<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Disjoint-set_data_structure\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Disjoint-set_data_structure</a> ）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"class IdentityGraph {&#10;  private parent = new Map&lt;string, string&gt;(); // union-find&#10;&#10;  find(x: string): string {&#10;    let r = x;&#10;    while (this.parent.get(r) &amp;&amp; this.parent.get(r) !== r) r = this.parent.get(r)!;&#10;    while (this.parent.get(x) &amp;&amp; this.parent.get(x) !== r) {&#10;      // 路径压缩&#10;      const nxt = this.parent.get(x)!;&#10;      this.parent.set(x, r);&#10;      x = nxt;&#10;    }&#10;    return r;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  union(a: string, b: string): void {&#10;    this.parent.set(this.find(a), this.find(b));&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  entityOf(userId: string): string {&#10;    return this.find(userId);&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> IdentityGraph</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> parent</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// union-find</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  find</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">x</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.parent.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(r) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.parent.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(r) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r) r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.parent.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(r)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.parent.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(x) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.parent.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(x) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      // 路径压缩</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nxt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.parent.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(x)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.parent.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(x, r);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nxt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  union</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.parent.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">find</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(a), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">find</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(b));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  entityOf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">userId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">find</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(userId);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>限领计数落在 <code>entityOf(userId)</code> 上，于是 200 个小号共享同一张券额度。要注意<strong>置信度分层</strong>：支付账号相同才无脑合并；共用 IP 只能记为&quot;疑似&quot;，用于提高风险分而非直接拒绝（否则公司 WiFi 下整个办公室会互相牵连，这是最常见的误伤来源）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"行为识别-脚本与真人的区别\">行为识别：脚本与真人的区别</h2><p>身份去重挡住&quot;多账号&quot;，但挡不住&quot;一个账号用脚本秒抢&quot;。行为风控看的是<strong>动作的时序特征</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>真人</th>\n<th>脚本</th>\n<th>判定用法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>点击间隔</td>\n<td>有随机抖动（数百 ms 量级）</td>\n<td>极稳定（±几 ms）</td>\n<td>方差过小 → 可疑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>从页面加载到点击</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n<td>毫秒级</td>\n<td>无浏览即点击 → 可疑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>请求顺序</td>\n<td>会漏、会退、会重看</td>\n<td>严格按接口顺序</td>\n<td>完美顺序 → 可疑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>鼠标/触摸轨迹</td>\n<td>有曲线与停顿</td>\n<td>直线或缺失</td>\n<td>无轨迹 → 可疑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并发度</td>\n<td>一人一个会话</td>\n<td>同账号多并发</td>\n<td>同账号并发 &gt; 阈值 → 拦截</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这些特征的共同点是可以<strong>在线计算</strong>，延迟开销小。做法是在请求链路上维护一个滑动窗口统计：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface RiskFeatures {&#10;  userId: string;&#10;  entityId: string;&#10;  clickIntervalMs: number[]; // 最近 N 次点击间隔&#10;  msSincePageLoad: number;&#10;  concurrentSessions: number;&#10;  deviceAgeDays: number; // 设备注册时长（新设备风险高）&#10;  claimCount1h: number;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RiskFeatures</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  userId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  entityId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  clickIntervalMs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[]; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 最近 N 次点击间隔</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  msSincePageLoad</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  concurrentSessions</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  deviceAgeDays</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 设备注册时长（新设备风险高）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  claimCount1h</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>一个务实的判定不是&quot;可疑就拒绝&quot;，而是<strong>分级处置</strong>，因为误伤真实用户的代价很高：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>风险分</th>\n<th>处置</th>\n<th>用户感知</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>高（&gt; 0.9）</td>\n<td>拒绝 + 记录</td>\n<td>提示&quot;活动太火爆，请稍后再试&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中（0.6–0.9）</td>\n<td>降级：延后发放 / 缩小面额 / 要求验证码</td>\n<td>轻微，多数不会察觉</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低（&lt; 0.6）</td>\n<td>放行，留痕</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>&quot;延后发放&quot;是个巧妙的中风险处置：不是不让领，而是把发放延后几分钟并降低优先级。真人不在乎多等三分钟，脚本的收益窗口却很窄（要抢在别人前面）。这类&quot;改变激励而非直接封堵&quot;的手段往往比硬拦更有效。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规则漏洞-最贵的资损来自配置而非攻击\">规则漏洞：最贵的资损来自配置而非攻击</h2><p>值得单独强调：<strong>大多数严重资损来自规则配置错误，而不是技术攻击</strong>。运营配了两个 <code>exclusiveGroup</code> 为空的活动，一个&quot;满 100 减 90&quot;，一个&quot;满 100 减 80&quot;，用户在结算页看到实付 0 元——这不需要任何技术手段。</p>\n<p>所以风控的一部分必须是<strong>静态检测</strong>，放在活动发布前（这一点在<a href=\"../promotion-model/stacking-exclusion\">叠加与互斥规则表达</a>里提到过，这里是它的风控视角）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>检测</th>\n<th>规则</th>\n<th>动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>减免上限</td>\n<td>单活动最大折扣率 &gt; 阈值（如 90%）</td>\n<td>需二级审批</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>叠加风险</td>\n<td>同范围多活动叠加后可能趋零</td>\n<td>拒绝发布或强制上限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>面额异常</td>\n<td>券面额 &gt; 该品类历史 P99</td>\n<td>告警，人工确认</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>门槛缺失</td>\n<td>现金券无门槛（<code>minSpend = 0</code>）</td>\n<td>需二级审批</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间窗异常</td>\n<td><code>endAt</code> 距今 &gt; 1 年或 &lt; 10 分钟</td>\n<td>告警</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>再加上运行时兜底：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>payable</mtext><mo>≥</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>costFloor</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{payable} \\ge \\max(0, \\text{costFloor})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">payable</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">costFloor</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <code>costFloor</code> 是商品成本下限（可配置为 0 或成本价的一定比例）。这条不变式在<a href=\"../pricing-pipeline/pricing-stages\">商品价→活动→券→实付的阶段</a>的出口断言里已经存在，风控视角的补充是：<strong>它应当是最后一道，而不是唯一一道</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"对抗度量-风控系统也需要被评估\">对抗度量：风控系统也需要被评估</h2><p>风控的难点是它没有干净的标签——你不知道被拦的人是真人还是羊毛党。所以必须用<strong>间接指标</strong>评估效果：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>计算</th>\n<th>期望</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>拦截率</td>\n<td>拦截数 / 命中风险规则数</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>误伤率</td>\n<td>被拦用户中 7 日内有正常购买的比例</td>\n<td>越低越好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实体聚集度</td>\n<td>单个实体（关联账号簇）平均账号数</td>\n<td>突增即预警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>券使用率</td>\n<td>发出的券被真实使用的比例</td>\n<td>高说明发给了目标用户</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>人均领券数分布</td>\n<td>P50 / P99 / max</td>\n<td>P99 突增即异常</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>退款率（券订单）</td>\n<td>用券订单的退款率</td>\n<td>高说明套利</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>券使用率</code>与<code>人均领券数分布</code>是最有信息量的两个。羊毛党领了券往往要快速变现（转卖或买高流通性商品再退款），而真实用户会正常消费。如果一场活动的券使用率突然从 60% 掉到 20%，几乎必然是发给了非目标人群。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT promotion_id,&#10;       COUNT(*) AS issued,&#10;       SUM(status = &#39;USED&#39;) / COUNT(*) AS usage_rate,&#10;       MAX(cnt) AS max_per_entity&#10;  FROM (&#10;    SELECT c.promotion_id, c.status, g.entity_id, COUNT(*) OVER (PARTITION BY g.entity_id) cnt&#10;      FROM coupon_instance c JOIN identity_entity g ON g.user_id = c.user_id&#10;  ) t&#10; GROUP BY promotion_id;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> promotion_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> issued,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'USED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> usage_rate,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       MAX</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cnt) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> max_per_entity</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">promotion_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">g</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">entity_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> g</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">entity_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) cnt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> coupon_instance c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> identity_entity g </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> g</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">user_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">user_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ) t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> promotion_id;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这类查询应当每天定时跑，结果既进风控名单回灌，也进<a href=\"promotion-observability\">促销效果归因与预算监控</a>的效果报表——同一份数据支撑两个目的。（查询里的 <code>COUNT(*) OVER (PARTITION BY ...)</code> 是窗口函数，它对每一行基于相关联的一组行做计算、按分区聚合却<strong>不折叠</strong>行——与 <code>GROUP BY</code> 不同，这正是&quot;每张券一行同时带上其所属实体的总数&quot;所需要的；窗口函数由 MySQL 8.0 引入，来源：MySQL 8.0 官方手册 Window Functions，<a href=\"https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.0/en/window-functions.html\">https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.0/en/window-functions.html</a> ）</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>被薅的对象有三类：<strong>券与预算</strong>（量）、<strong>叠加漏洞</strong>（质）、<strong>套利</strong>（时间）；只做限领会漏掉后两类。</li>\n<li>身份去重是有效限领的前提：用<strong>并查集把强信号（支付账号、手机号、精确地址）相同的账号合并为一个实体</strong>，限领计数落在实体上；弱信号（IP）只提高风险分，不直接合并，避免误伤。</li>\n<li>行为识别看时序特征（点击间隔方差、页面停留、并发度），处置<strong>分级</strong>：高风险拒绝、中风险降级（延后/缩小面额）、低风险放行留痕。</li>\n<li><strong>最贵的资损来自规则配置错误</strong>，所以风控必须包含活动发布前的静态检测（折扣上限、叠加风险、面额异常、缺失门槛）。</li>\n<li>运行时兜底不变量 <code>payable ≥ costFloor</code> 是最后一道，不是唯一一道。</li>\n<li>风控效果用间接指标度量：<strong>券使用率</strong>与<strong>人均领券数分布</strong>最有信息量；离线识别的结果必须回灌在线判定，形成闭环。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"羊毛党识别与领券风控","id":"羊毛党识别与领券风控"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"身份去重：把\"200 个小号\"识别成一个实体","id":"身份去重-把-200-个小号-识别成一个实体"},{"level":2,"text":"行为识别：脚本与真人的区别","id":"行为识别-脚本与真人的区别"},{"level":2,"text":"规则漏洞：最贵的资损来自配置而非攻击","id":"规则漏洞-最贵的资损来自配置而非攻击"},{"level":2,"text":"对抗度量：风控系统也需要被评估","id":"对抗度量-风控系统也需要被评估"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"活动规则缓存与实时生效","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/promotion-pricing-engine/performance-safety/pricing-cache"},"next":{"title":"促销效果归因与预算监控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/promotion-pricing-engine/performance-safety/promotion-observability"}}